  "rules": [
    "Products are platform-only. Courses are free.",
    "One coupon per order. Rental dates: start inclusive, end exclusive.",
    "Broker orders are fulfilled by broker/agency and invisible to merchants.",
    "Contract files are private; access requires order-participant authorization.",
    "Platform explicitly confirms per-order profit and broker/member beneficiaries. No default distributions; total distribution cannot exceed profit.",
    "Membership validity is six months per explicit platform grant.",
    "Real payment/SMS integrations return 503 when unavailable. Test payment requires APP_ENV development/test and ALLOW_TEST_PAYMENTS=1.",
    "Partial successful refund freezes the order ledger and requires manual remaining-profit reconfirmation using the original beneficiaries and rule snapshot; no refund-proportional profit estimate.",
    "Physical course gifts remain pending_fulfillment until platform evidence; event invitations are eligibility and do not imply enrollment.",
    "Invitation code is optional, validated only if filled, and affects configured growth only; no financial referral relation.",
    "Points redemption uses atomic user/stock locks and idempotent negative growth ledger; physical delivery requires platform evidence.",
    "Management sub-roles narrow module access beneath base identities and organizations; order profit/refund requires finance; account identity/organization changes require full platform access.",
    "Purchase options are configured on the selected physical boat resource; boat-type parameters do not imply purchasable instance options.",
    "Withdrawal requests require a caller-generated idempotency_key; the same user/key/amount returns the original request, changed amount rejects.",
    "Customer tags are agency-scoped normalized relations. Monthly company performance uses successful payment/refund transaction month, not order creation or quotation.",
    "Boat coordinates are actual operator-supplied paired numbers or paired null; no synthetic location or implicit GPS.",
    "Activity enrollment and event-order creation require an active consumer, identity_status verified by platform material review, and member_until later than now. Identity review is not an external verification provider.",
    "Free unredeemed activity tickets may be cancelled by their owner with the current ticket_code; capacity is released once. Priced activity orders use unpaid order cancellation or paid refund requests. Unconfigured real refunds refuse and leave enrollment unchanged."
  ],
